# eliothmonroy.xyz

Follow `AGENTS.md` at the repo root. It is the source of truth for stack, layout, commands, and boundaries.

## Cursor-specific

- This is a static GitHub Pages site. There is no dev server or bundler. Preview by opening the HTML file or serving the repo root as static files.
- After any UI, layout, routing, or client-state change, verify the flow in the browser. A screenshot is not enough; click through the changed path. Check other pages that share the same files.
- World Cup Simulator tests: `node --test WorldCupSimulator/tests/logic.test.js`. Run them after changing `logic.js` or the test file.
- Do not add `.cursor` config, frameworks, or a package manager unless asked.
